  "title": "Qt: Profile Dialog: Don't pass in an invalid model index",
  "description": "Avoid a fencepost error by using columnCount() - 1, not columnCount(),\nand thus don't produce an invalid QModelIndex.\n\nPrevents warnings like:\n\n[GUI WARNING] -- dataChanged() called with an invalid index range:\n    topleft: QModelIndex(0,0,0x55d7f873d6d0,ProfileSortModel(0x55d7f8736d20))\n    bottomRight:QModelIndex(-1,-1,0x0,QObject(0x0))\n\nFix #21262\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
  "state": "merged",
